    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Garry O’Donnell of ERA Downey McCarthy Auctioneers is delighted to bring to the market this superbly presented three bedroom semi-detached property, ideally located in the highly sought after Carraig na Curra development in Carrigaline. Perfectly suited to first time buyers, this attractive home has recently been refurbished and is presented in excellent condition throughout. Recent upgrades include a stylish modern fitted kitchen, new LVT A-rated flooring and fresh paintwork in a warm and inviting colour palette. The property is ideally positioned within a quiet cul-de-sac and enjoys a sunny rear aspect.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises a welcoming reception hallway, guest w.c, living room and spacious open plan kitchen/dining area on the ground floor. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en suite, together with a main family bathroom. This well-maintained home combines modern presentation with generous living accommodation and a desirable location, making it an excellent opportunity for those seeking a comfortable home in Carrigaline."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The front of the property features an attractive maintenance free façade of red brick and dash finish. A concrete driveway facilitates off-street parking for two cars and there is a garden area which is laid to lawn. \r\n\r\nThe rear of the property benefits from a south facing aspect. The area is fully enclosed with PVC panel fencing, timber fencing, and concrete post and panel. The rear garden is laid to lawn."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Reception Hallway - 4.54m x 1.85m \r\nA teak door with stained glass centre and side panelling allows access to the main reception hallway. This beautifully presented reception hallway features attractive décor with high quality LVT flooring. There is one centre light piece, one radiator, two power points, two telephone points, one smoke alarm, and extensive under stair storage. An oak door from the hallway allows access to a guest w.c.\r\n\r\nGuest W.C - \r\nThe guest w.c features a two piece suite and is finished with LVT flooring, wall tiling, one centre light piece and one extractor fan.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 5.01m x 3.54m \r\nA superb main living room has a feature bay window to the front of the property adding an extra dimension of living space in the room. The area is finished with high quality LVT flooring, attractive décor, and an impressive open fireplace. There is one centre light piece, one radiator, six power points, one television point, and oak double doors with glass panelling allow access to the open plan kitchen/dining area.\r\n\r\nOpen Plan Kitchen/Dining - 3.57m x 5.54m \r\nA superb open plan kitchen/dining area features high quality newly fitted kitchen units at eye and floor level in an attractive colour palette with extensive worktop counter space. The kitchen includes plumbing for a washing machine and dishwasher, a stainless steel sink and drainer unit, an integrated oven, hob and extractor fan, and space for a American style fridge freezer. The room is finished with  LVT flooring, one window overlooking the rear of the property, and a sliding door allowing access to same. \n\nThere is extensive dining space, a feature centre light piece, one large radiator, and twelve power points.\r\n\r\nStairs and Landing - 2.99m x 2.06m \r\nThe stairs and landing are fitted with new high grade carpet flooring throughout. The landing area has one centre light piece, an access hatch to the attic, a mains operated smoke alarm, and access to the hot press which is shelved for storage.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.24m x 3.4m \r\nA large double bedroom finished with solid timber flooring and attractive décor has one window to the rear of the property. There is one centre light piece, one large radiator, five power points, one telephone point, and a door allowing access to an en suite bathroom. \r\n\r\nEn Suite - 0.9m x 2.5m \r\nThe en suite features a three piece suite, including an electric shower. The room has solid timber flooring, wall tiling, one centre light piece, and one extractor fan.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.56m x 3.39m \r\nA large double bedroom finished with attractive decor has one window to the front of the property, one centre light piece, one large radiator, and four power points.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.54m x 2.44m \r\nA spacious single bedroom finished with attractive decor has one window to the front of the property, one centre light piece, one large radiator, and two power points.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.19m x 2.06m \r\nThe main family bathroom features a three piece suite including a mains operated shower fitter over the bath. The room has LVT flooring, wall tiling, one window to the rear of the property, one centre light piece, and one radiator.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Newly installed fitted kitchen\r\nNew flooring \r\nRecently repainted\r\nApprox. 86.15 Sq. M. / 927 Sq. Ft. \r\nBuilt in 2002\r\nBER C\r\nDouble glazed PVC windows\r\nGas fired central heating - new Bosch gas boiler installed earlier this year\r\nThree spacious bedrooms\r\nTurnkey condition\r\nSunny rear garden\r\nSought after location conveniently located close to all amenities and services in Carrigaline\r\nIdeal first time buy"
      },
